し。目元に赤色のアイシャドウ、下睫毛。\n【口】薄めに赤色の口紅を塗っています。\nアクセサリー：舌に丸い銀色の舌ピアス、赤い宝石のピアス、スクエア型のアンダーリム眼鏡\n【性格】傲慢でプライド高め。\n自分の思い通りにいかないと気が済まない。自分以外の者は下等な者と見なす。女王様。\n【年齢】20代後半〜30代\n【属性】闇属性、ヴィラン(混沌・悪)\n【詳細】人喰いの人型人外。\n普段は笑顔で優しく紳士な振る舞いをするが、実際は冷酷で鬼畜外道。人間を誑かし、唆してはその様を眺めて楽しむ。一言で言えばクズ。\n【絵文字モチーフ】🥀🕷🕸🍷\n\n【キャラクター立ち絵やその他詳細】\nGoogleDriveに置いてあります。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-T-JG4JagbdCioOT80XH50CGdloIkrMa\n\nご検討の程、宜しくお願い致します🙇🏻", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 490192, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "揚蝶🦋", "screen_name": "_____agehasera", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1957365735799590912/xQlPEows.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1092013847924199424/1778391762/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": true, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "correction"}], "banned": false, "nc": 17}, {"id": 1032985, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "なきぢ", "screen_name": "nakididioso", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1875135529039413249/SPNo6UB9.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4221506414/1778580714/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 176}, {"id": 2403352, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "らすちむ", "screen_name": "Rasuchimu", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1832423294915526656/VAVLiNQc.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profil